WEBVTT

01:40.720 --> 01:45.720
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.370 --> 01:50.830
[Episode 24]

01:57.759 --> 01:58.840
Next,

01:59.280 --> 02:03.840
I, Li Quzhuo, the genius second son

02:04.730 --> 02:06.150
of the Li family from Peach Garden, will

02:06.150 --> 02:08.810
report our investigation results to everyone.

02:09.680 --> 02:12.810
Huaizhu, try some of these raisins.
They're delicious.

02:15.440 --> 02:17.300
Puppy Li, that's enough from you.

02:17.400 --> 02:18.329
Get to the point.

02:23.200 --> 02:27.130
At the spy's hideout, the information of which
was provided by Hongye,

02:27.640 --> 02:29.960
and with Qinlan's help, of course,

02:30.400 --> 02:32.079
we caught a spy.

02:33.360 --> 02:35.150
I placed three talismans on him,

02:35.150 --> 02:38.280
and so we found his lair.

02:36.570 --> 02:38.360
[Dungeon] [Li Garden]

02:38.560 --> 02:41.800
Li... Garden!

02:42.910 --> 02:45.380
The leader is a honey badger demon,

02:45.840 --> 02:47.240
known as "Flathead,"

02:47.430 --> 02:49.090
nicknamed "The Unkillable."

02:55.640 --> 02:57.430
[National Preceptor's Residence, Beast Kingdom]

02:57.360 --> 02:59.460
Go find me some new demons.

03:00.100 --> 03:02.360
If the demons you offered still can't be selected

03:02.360 --> 03:05.310
in the new round of demon selection at the Drunken Dream Tower,

03:05.310 --> 03:07.570
you all have to participate personally.

03:07.570 --> 03:08.200
Yes.

03:25.430 --> 03:28.030
It was nothing but a disobedient little demon.

03:28.590 --> 03:30.120
There's no need to cover up.

03:30.410 --> 03:33.230
Your dealings have nothing to do with me.

03:35.360 --> 03:37.910
What? Are you still angry?

03:39.750 --> 03:41.220
I was wrong.

03:41.600 --> 03:43.890
I kept that indenture back then

03:44.560 --> 03:46.130
just as a memento.

03:46.150 --> 03:47.090
Memento?

03:48.740 --> 03:49.910
That's not what you said

03:49.910 --> 03:51.770
when you threatened me back then.

03:51.829 --> 03:54.150
You said the indenture was in the hands of
someone you trust.

03:54.150 --> 03:55.280
If you died,

03:56.370 --> 03:58.510
he'd immediately reveal the secret.

03:59.310 --> 04:01.650
For the sake of that deceased
Young Master Zhang,

04:01.650 --> 04:03.140
you would do anything.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.650
So I had to keep a trump card.

04:06.840 --> 04:08.370
Then let's cut to the chase.

04:09.240 --> 04:11.010
The matter of killing Wangquan Hongye

04:11.010 --> 04:12.170
ends here.

04:12.520 --> 04:14.250
I won't be threatened anymore.

04:15.400 --> 04:18.670
So you also don't care about the Zhang
family's fate anymore?

04:18.670 --> 04:22.280
If Wangquan Hongye finds out you're my son,

04:22.800 --> 04:24.600
what do you think

04:25.040 --> 04:26.640
he'll do to the Zhang family?

04:31.630 --> 04:35.600
Wangquan Hongye suddenly came to visit
the Beast Kingdom in secret.

04:36.680 --> 04:39.210
Have you considered what the reason

04:40.040 --> 04:41.240
behind this could be?

04:42.600 --> 04:46.360
Could it be that he's here specifically
to investigate you?

04:46.950 --> 04:48.150
What did you tell him?

04:48.390 --> 04:49.600
Nothing, really.

04:49.860 --> 04:51.960
It's just my speculation.

04:52.830 --> 04:53.630
However,

04:55.000 --> 04:57.680
you know Wangquan Hongye.

04:57.720 --> 04:59.260
He's very clever

04:59.750 --> 05:01.350
and ruthless in his methods.

05:02.000 --> 05:03.620
If you don't kill him today,

05:04.040 --> 05:06.290
in the future, will he spare you?

05:06.390 --> 05:08.120
Will he spare the Zhang family?

05:09.390 --> 05:10.380
Ran.

05:11.190 --> 05:13.160
I am the one who did you wrong.

05:13.750 --> 05:17.310
But that Young Master Zhang
has shown you kindness.

05:21.040 --> 05:21.630
Fine.

05:22.950 --> 05:24.750
I will go kill Wangquan Hongye.

05:26.000 --> 05:27.040
But from now on,

05:29.510 --> 05:31.720
you be the National Preceptor
of the Beast Kingdom,

05:31.720 --> 05:33.650
and I'll be Dark Sword Zhang Zheng.

05:35.770 --> 05:38.560
I've... Been waiting for you to say that.

05:39.240 --> 05:41.190
The Beast Kingdom's spies have launched
a comprehensive manhunt

05:41.190 --> 05:42.920
to search for Wangquan Hongye.

05:43.390 --> 05:46.790
As soon as there's any news,
they'll inform you immediately.

05:48.780 --> 05:50.510
We've been talking for a while.

05:51.040 --> 05:52.100
You must be hungry.

05:53.659 --> 05:57.159
Would you like to stay and have
one last meal with me?

05:58.390 --> 06:00.160
The last time I cooked for you

06:00.630 --> 06:02.800
was over 20 years ago.

06:04.610 --> 06:07.340
If only that Young Master Zhang were still alive.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.240
He was so kind.

06:10.680 --> 06:12.930
He would surely persuade you to agree.

06:29.600 --> 06:32.240
Once you eat the meal I made
with my own hands,

06:33.680 --> 06:37.000
you'll be mine forever.

07:18.030 --> 07:19.740
[Honey Badger Demon]

07:24.390 --> 07:25.390
Snake demon.

07:33.830 --> 07:35.200
We don't want your life.

07:35.730 --> 07:36.520
Tell us,

07:36.760 --> 07:38.020
where's the assassin?

07:39.270 --> 07:41.040
You think you can leave?

07:48.190 --> 07:49.530
What are you all waiting for?

07:49.530 --> 07:52.990
Think about what would happen to you
if the information leaks.

07:55.870 --> 07:56.550
You...

08:01.130 --> 08:02.900
What's brewing in this cauldron

08:02.900 --> 08:04.940
are all herbs for pain relief
and life preservation.

08:04.940 --> 08:06.800
And the dosage is extremely high.

08:06.820 --> 08:08.920
You're already at the end of your rope.

08:08.920 --> 08:09.950
I can't die yet.

08:10.750 --> 08:11.990
If I die,

08:12.390 --> 08:14.630
these fools will immediately make mistakes.

08:14.630 --> 08:16.270
They won't even know how they died.

08:16.270 --> 08:18.330
The reason you're living in such pain

08:18.750 --> 08:20.750
is to protect these spies, isn't it?

08:24.430 --> 08:26.090
Tell me where the assassin is,

08:26.170 --> 08:28.350
and I'll pretend I was never here.

08:29.130 --> 08:30.930
You've seen what we're capable of.

08:30.930 --> 08:32.470
You have no other choice.

08:54.270 --> 08:55.120
Is it here?

09:30.910 --> 09:31.940
So it's you.

09:43.910 --> 09:44.710
Master Zhang.

09:45.360 --> 09:47.910
You tried to assassinate me in the Beast Kingdom.

09:47.910 --> 09:50.470
Were you trying to betray the
entire Yiqi Alliance?

09:50.470 --> 09:52.550
I don't understand what
you're talking about.

09:52.550 --> 09:54.000
Since you don't understand,

09:54.000 --> 09:56.960
show me the wound on your leg.

10:07.150 --> 10:08.200
Do you think

10:09.080 --> 10:10.510
you can escape?

10:14.080 --> 10:14.840
Hongye!

10:17.770 --> 10:19.900
This matter has nothing to do with her.

10:26.150 --> 10:27.150
I'll go with you.

10:41.100 --> 10:43.960
So what you've been concerned about all along

10:44.590 --> 10:46.650
is Master Zhang, right, Miss Qingmu?

10:47.470 --> 10:51.130
Dark Sword Zhang Zheng, in his quest to
be the world's greatest swordsman,

10:51.130 --> 10:53.320
has been opposing Wangquan Manor at every turn.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.390
That day when he tried to assassinate me at Ruyi Pavilion,

10:55.390 --> 10:57.390
did you know about it and not tell me?

10:57.390 --> 10:58.240
Yes.

10:59.240 --> 11:01.040
What else are you hiding from me?

11:16.430 --> 11:17.430
Hongye.

11:19.550 --> 11:22.960
If I tell you Zhang Zheng had his reasons
for trying to assassinate you,

11:22.960 --> 11:24.200
can you spare him?

11:24.440 --> 11:27.240
You already believe in your heart
that I wouldn't spare him.

11:27.240 --> 11:29.030
That's why you rushed here tonight,

11:29.030 --> 11:30.320
wanting to rescue him.

11:30.600 --> 11:32.460
Hongye, you said it yourself that

11:34.960 --> 11:36.890
he opposes Wangquan at every turn.

11:37.240 --> 11:39.320
He's the biggest rival to your
Yiqi Alliance.

11:39.320 --> 11:40.200
So?

11:41.080 --> 11:42.910
So you think now that I know his secret,

11:42.910 --> 11:43.960
I won't spare him,

11:44.600 --> 11:46.930
and I won't spare the entire Zhang family.

11:47.120 --> 11:47.910
Yuan, you...

11:52.440 --> 11:53.320
So, is this

11:54.610 --> 11:56.410
the kind of person you think I am?

11:59.200 --> 11:59.910
Hongye.

12:02.120 --> 12:03.600
I truly like him.

12:14.670 --> 12:16.120
I'll tell you everything I know

12:16.120 --> 12:17.000
right now.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.640
That's how things stand.

12:24.270 --> 12:25.270
I want to save him.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.280
I want to kill Anayan.

12:27.870 --> 12:30.600
Zhang Zheng must have some leverage in her hands.

12:31.200 --> 12:33.000
But Anayan wouldn't be so stupid

12:33.030 --> 12:34.890
as to carry the evidence with her.

12:34.910 --> 12:37.710
She should've entrusted
the evidence to someone.

12:37.870 --> 12:38.910
Once she's dead,

12:39.120 --> 12:41.720
the evidence will be made public immediately.

12:43.390 --> 12:45.920
You've already issued a standing kill order?

12:46.330 --> 12:47.860
The bounty is 10,000 taels.

12:48.630 --> 12:49.890
I'll immediately give an order to recall it.

12:49.890 --> 12:51.420
I'll also inform Yitan right away.

12:51.420 --> 12:52.690
Activate your intelligence network

12:52.690 --> 12:54.750
and track all of Anayan's movements.

12:54.830 --> 12:56.490
If this person really exists,

12:56.780 --> 12:59.180
he's probably hiding in the Yiqi Alliance.

13:04.440 --> 13:05.960
Quickly, find someone to look into this.

13:05.960 --> 13:07.960
Yuan will give you the information.

13:28.720 --> 13:30.380
Finally, there's something to do.

13:30.380 --> 13:31.150
Say it.

13:31.670 --> 13:33.320
What great demon are we dealing with

13:33.320 --> 13:35.000
that you need my help?

13:35.150 --> 13:36.630
He asked us to find someone

13:37.570 --> 13:39.430
hidden within the Yiqi Alliance.

13:39.910 --> 13:42.310
This person has leverage over Zhang Zheng.

13:42.790 --> 13:44.120
Dark Sword Zhang Zheng?

13:45.120 --> 13:47.580
Since when did Hongye get involved with him?

13:55.760 --> 13:58.090
[Three days later]

14:06.440 --> 14:07.500
You must be hungry.

14:12.320 --> 14:13.250
Go ahead and eat.

14:15.000 --> 14:15.790
What?

14:16.320 --> 14:18.050
Have you decided how to kill me?

14:18.510 --> 14:19.750
Is this my last meal?

14:21.120 --> 14:22.650
There's no asparagus in it.

14:23.080 --> 14:23.840
Try it.

14:28.200 --> 14:29.200
Wangquan Hongye,

14:30.630 --> 14:32.090
what exactly are you up to?

14:36.040 --> 14:37.040
In your eyes,

14:38.360 --> 14:41.840
am I really such a despicable person?

14:44.090 --> 14:47.380
Dongfang Huaizhu is that sword attendant
from the Nangong family.

14:47.380 --> 14:50.610
The Nangong family incident was your joint doing.

14:52.420 --> 14:53.680
So you still remember.

14:55.360 --> 14:57.600
It seems besides worrying about Qingmu Yuan,

14:57.600 --> 15:02.660
you're also worried that the Zhang family will become
the next Nangong family, aren't you?

15:03.960 --> 15:05.360
Let me ask you a question.

15:06.440 --> 15:07.000
Go ahead.

15:07.550 --> 15:09.720
Nangong Ye has tried to woo you many times.

15:09.720 --> 15:11.670
You've had many chances to surpass me and

15:11.670 --> 15:14.000
become the world's greatest swordsman
using the demon core.

15:14.000 --> 15:15.120
Why did you refuse?

15:15.720 --> 15:16.910
I want to defeat you,

15:18.910 --> 15:20.240
but with the Dark Sword.

15:22.790 --> 15:24.450
It must be with the Dark Sword.

15:28.600 --> 15:30.400
Is it because of the exhortation

15:30.430 --> 15:32.030
that person entrusted to you

15:32.680 --> 15:34.040
with her life?

15:39.520 --> 15:40.510
Yuan has told me

15:41.090 --> 15:42.340
your secret.

15:46.390 --> 15:49.850
Here's something I've just obtained.

15:46.520 --> 15:47.570
[Indenture]

15:50.370 --> 15:52.870
[Indenture]

15:52.870 --> 15:54.320
[Signed by: Anayan]
[Signed by: Zhang Jian]

16:00.860 --> 16:02.680
Anayan is very cunning.

16:03.400 --> 16:04.530
When selling her son that day,

16:04.530 --> 16:07.930
she made Master Zhang personally
handwrite this indenture.

16:08.640 --> 16:10.900
Although Master Zhang used a false name,

16:11.090 --> 16:13.420
once you compare the handwriting,

16:13.840 --> 16:15.900
you'll know whose handwriting it is.

16:17.460 --> 16:18.640
Wangquan Hongye.

16:19.720 --> 16:21.380
What exactly do you want to do?

16:23.720 --> 16:26.970
So this is what has been threatening you
for so long?

16:29.670 --> 16:30.610
No matter what,

16:33.340 --> 16:35.400
I won't be threatened by you anymore.

16:54.460 --> 16:56.910
I really don't quite understand you anymore.

16:56.910 --> 16:58.370
If I say

16:58.510 --> 16:59.270
I've always been grateful

16:59.270 --> 17:01.200
to have someone like you by my side,

17:01.200 --> 17:03.610
a swordsman who could surpass me at any time,

17:03.610 --> 17:04.810
would you believe me?

17:09.640 --> 17:10.880
It seems you don't.

17:12.420 --> 17:15.339
Then can I exchange this gift for

17:16.349 --> 17:18.510
a chance for you to know me next time?

17:24.970 --> 17:26.589
The wontons are getting cold.

17:26.589 --> 17:27.420
Eat up.

17:55.560 --> 17:59.250
In the Yiqi Alliance, the Wangquan Sword
commands respect from the masses,

17:59.250 --> 18:01.720
while the Dark Sword protects the realm
and strengthens itself.

18:01.720 --> 18:04.890
These two have never been in conflict.

18:14.110 --> 18:15.710
Are you really letting me go?

18:15.900 --> 18:17.750
I know your prejudice runs deep,

18:17.770 --> 18:19.300
and it won't change easily.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.350
But I still hope

18:22.030 --> 18:23.960
you can understand my intentions.

18:30.990 --> 18:32.440
If I'm not mistaken,

18:32.790 --> 18:36.050
this jade piece was given to you
by Young Master, wasn't it?

18:38.110 --> 18:40.110
Young Master was such a good person.

18:40.510 --> 18:42.400
What he left you before he passed away

18:42.400 --> 18:43.640
must not be a shackle.

18:46.360 --> 18:47.950
Don't feel guilty.

18:48.300 --> 18:50.480
This is all my own choice.

18:52.110 --> 18:53.750
It has nothing to do with you.

18:54.840 --> 18:58.140
I hope you can live well.

19:01.110 --> 19:02.860
Take good care of yourself.

19:06.530 --> 19:07.860
As long as you live well.

19:09.880 --> 19:11.960
That's the only thing I want from you.

19:24.310 --> 19:25.450
Wangquan Hongye.

19:25.850 --> 19:28.710
It was Anayan who instructed me
to assassinate you.

19:29.570 --> 19:32.230
I think she's been acting on the ruler's orders.

19:34.000 --> 19:35.620
She's the owner of the Drunken Dream Tower.

19:35.620 --> 19:36.800
Recently, she's been selecting demons

19:36.800 --> 19:38.350
to do something very dangerous.

19:38.350 --> 19:40.610
I already have some clues on this matter.

19:40.740 --> 19:41.500
Zhang Zheng,

19:43.000 --> 19:44.330
can I ask you for a favor?

19:44.720 --> 19:45.440
What is it?

19:49.770 --> 19:52.000
Zhang Zheng... Is pretty good.

19:56.440 --> 19:57.640
Better than me?

19:58.440 --> 20:00.440
He and Qingmu Yuan make a good match.

20:04.110 --> 20:06.040
Then why didn't Yuan come herself?

20:06.870 --> 20:10.070
There are some things they have to figure out
on their own.

21:20.920 --> 21:21.790
My Lady,

21:21.810 --> 21:23.670
what are you looking at?

21:24.400 --> 21:25.270
Nothing.

21:33.130 --> 21:34.300
Meng Yun, I'm going out for a while.

21:34.300 --> 21:35.390
Going out again?

21:35.510 --> 21:37.530
By the way, where's the sword tassel
I ordered earlier?

21:37.530 --> 21:38.670
You mean this?

22:15.520 --> 22:16.440
That night,

22:20.000 --> 22:21.200
you already knew.

22:25.880 --> 22:26.720
Sorry.

22:29.310 --> 22:32.400
I used a smoke bomb on you that day.

22:33.420 --> 22:34.400
So, now you know

22:37.880 --> 22:39.940
I'm Young Master's stand-in, right?

22:40.640 --> 22:41.900
Yes, and there's more.

22:43.340 --> 22:44.070
What?

22:45.880 --> 22:47.830
Now I know why after we turned 18,

22:48.310 --> 22:49.770
you stopped talking to me.

22:51.000 --> 22:52.460
The shackles on your heart

22:52.960 --> 22:53.830
are too heavy.

22:54.240 --> 22:56.100
[Those who love you hope you live for yourself.]

23:01.550 --> 23:02.280
Zhang Zheng!

23:02.720 --> 23:04.720
Zhang Zheng, what's wrong with you?

23:04.880 --> 23:05.680
Zhang Zheng!

23:09.200 --> 23:11.200
There are blue scales under your eyes.

23:11.200 --> 23:13.800
It's the demon poison of
the Nine-headed Bird.

23:14.390 --> 23:16.120
Your eye color has changed too.

23:16.190 --> 23:18.200
The demon poison has entered
your bloodstream.

23:18.200 --> 23:19.490
How could this happen?

23:21.270 --> 23:24.000
Anayan. It must be Anayan.

23:25.820 --> 23:26.550
Zhang Zheng!

23:28.790 --> 23:30.830
The bird poison has reached your heart.

23:30.830 --> 23:32.380
Even if I take you back to Ruyi Pavilion,

23:32.380 --> 23:33.940
it'll be too late to detoxify you.

23:33.940 --> 23:35.230
Zhang Zheng.

23:38.310 --> 23:41.750
This is the only way now.

23:42.240 --> 23:45.170
The blood exchange cauldron of the Leech Demon Clan.

23:45.630 --> 23:47.560
I can only exchange blood with him,

23:47.590 --> 23:49.520
draw the demon poison into my body,

23:50.030 --> 23:53.370
and try to suppress it before the poison
reaches his heart.

24:00.370 --> 24:01.330
Zhang Zheng.

24:02.070 --> 24:04.200
I want you to be indebted to me forever.

25:12.760 --> 25:15.010
[Those who love you hope you live for yourself.]

25:17.310 --> 25:18.550
What just happened?

26:25.590 --> 26:26.350
Be careful.

26:31.070 --> 26:31.830
What?

26:32.960 --> 26:36.030
Are you more interested in this thing
than in me?

26:37.720 --> 26:38.880
Why are you jealous?

26:39.920 --> 26:41.850
You know you're always in my heart.

26:42.220 --> 26:44.760
Forget it. I've seen through you long ago.

26:45.510 --> 26:47.270
You only dare to call me over

26:47.270 --> 26:48.930
when Miss Huaizhu isn't home.

26:49.070 --> 26:54.400
Aren't you just worried that someone will find out and stop you
from marrying into their family?

26:56.510 --> 26:57.910
You're overthinking it.

26:58.270 --> 27:01.600
I, Jin Renfeng, have plenty of ways
to make a name for myself.

27:02.480 --> 27:03.480
What ways?

27:04.110 --> 27:05.170
Tell me about them.

27:08.980 --> 27:11.730
Could it be... This?

27:14.440 --> 27:15.770
I'll tell you next time.

27:15.950 --> 27:17.350
It's getting late today.

27:20.590 --> 27:22.230
Alright. Whatever you say.

27:22.680 --> 27:24.480
After all, you're the one I like.

27:26.350 --> 27:27.810
Take your time to study it.

27:40.020 --> 27:42.480
This is indeed a superior magical artifact.

27:43.030 --> 27:44.800
It was fixed so quickly.

27:46.110 --> 27:47.270
Jin Renfeng.

27:52.420 --> 27:53.900
Lord Jiuhuo, is that you?

27:54.960 --> 27:57.510
That Anayan is incompetent.

27:58.400 --> 28:00.160
Go check on the Beast Kingdom.

28:02.240 --> 28:03.030
Yes.

28:23.350 --> 28:25.280
What do you want to talk to me about?

28:25.440 --> 28:26.030
Go ahead.

28:28.090 --> 28:31.100
Qinlan, you love Huaizhu very much,
don't you?

28:31.720 --> 28:32.590
Of course.

28:32.590 --> 28:34.920
Then if there's someone
Huaizhu really likes,

28:34.920 --> 28:36.310
but you don't like them,

28:36.380 --> 28:37.460
what would you do?

28:40.810 --> 28:43.140
Well, answer a few questions for me first.

28:45.110 --> 28:47.270
Do you know what Huaizhu likes to eat?

28:47.880 --> 28:48.880
Yin Cake and fish.

28:48.920 --> 28:49.960
Then what is she good at?

28:49.960 --> 28:51.180
She's not skilled in the four arts.

28:51.180 --> 28:52.540
She doesn't like composing poems,

28:52.540 --> 28:54.680
nor can she cook, do laundry, or make beds.

28:54.680 --> 28:57.390
But she likes fighting and magic duels.

28:57.510 --> 28:58.720
Very good.

28:59.160 --> 29:01.590
So do you know why she doesn't fight easily?

29:03.890 --> 29:06.310
Because Divine Fire Villa has
restrained her.

29:06.310 --> 29:07.880
Although she's content with it,

29:07.880 --> 29:09.200
I feel sorry for her.

29:09.790 --> 29:11.390
If you two get together,

29:11.790 --> 29:13.200
your Wangquan Sword

29:13.640 --> 29:15.500
and her Dongfang Spiritual Blood

29:15.790 --> 29:17.520
will be burdens

29:17.640 --> 29:18.830
for both of you.

29:20.440 --> 29:22.820
The reason why I like the Mask Group Leader

29:23.030 --> 29:24.680
is that Huaizhu likes him.

29:25.070 --> 29:26.350
What she fell in love with at first sight

29:26.350 --> 29:27.880
is actually what she yearns
for in her heart,

29:27.880 --> 29:29.110
the sense of freedom.

29:30.030 --> 29:31.290
Do you understand now?

29:32.400 --> 29:33.200
I do.

29:33.750 --> 29:36.240
Qinlan, you really love Huaizhu.

29:37.510 --> 29:39.160
Now you can back off, right?

29:41.080 --> 29:42.160
Now,

29:42.360 --> 29:44.560
I'm even more determined to pursue her.

29:45.920 --> 29:47.680
Why are you so stubborn?

29:53.400 --> 29:55.530
Because I also love Huaizhu very much.

29:55.710 --> 29:59.400
I believe I can give her
what she yearns for.

30:18.090 --> 30:19.240
What is this?

30:20.070 --> 30:22.590
This is called the Noble Lady
Leg-breaking Talisman.

30:22.590 --> 30:26.350
It's a masterpiece I poured my heart
and soul into creating.

30:26.700 --> 30:29.430
It's even more powerful than
my brother's works.

30:29.490 --> 30:31.250
So, do you want one?

30:36.690 --> 30:38.280
You look so dejected.

30:38.960 --> 30:40.290
It's not like you at all.

30:42.090 --> 30:43.020
Puppy Li.

30:44.640 --> 30:45.880
You have an older brother, right?

30:45.880 --> 30:46.720
Yes, I do.

30:48.030 --> 30:50.720
Then do you know what your brother likes

30:50.720 --> 30:51.920
and what he doesn't like?

30:51.920 --> 30:52.720
No, I don't.

30:52.720 --> 30:53.780
He's never told me.

30:55.160 --> 30:56.790
Being so carefree,

30:56.790 --> 30:59.790
aren't you worried you may
hurt your brother's feelings?

30:59.790 --> 31:00.720
I'm so excellent.

31:00.720 --> 31:02.520
Why should my brother feel hurt?

31:04.920 --> 31:07.400
I... Really like myself.

31:08.350 --> 31:09.960
I have a great personality,

31:10.240 --> 31:11.750
and I look pretty good.

31:12.440 --> 31:14.030
A lot of people love me,

31:14.510 --> 31:16.040
and there are people I love.

31:16.310 --> 31:17.640
I can eat and sleep well.

31:17.680 --> 31:19.740
Besides, I even eat more than others.

31:20.680 --> 31:22.360
I'm really special, aren't I?

31:26.980 --> 31:28.310
What exactly happened?

31:30.940 --> 31:32.350
I just...

31:34.110 --> 31:35.510
Feel sorry for Huaizhu.

31:36.750 --> 31:38.350
She's so nice to me,

31:39.000 --> 31:41.400
but I don't know how to repay her.

31:44.440 --> 31:45.240
Well,

31:46.550 --> 31:48.350
you're thinking about it wrong.

31:48.960 --> 31:51.350
Our older brothers and sisters raised us
to be carefree,

31:51.350 --> 31:52.680
naive, and daffy.

31:52.830 --> 31:54.960
They're actually very happy about it.

31:55.110 --> 31:58.440
As for us, we should just keep
the gratitude in our hearts,

31:58.440 --> 32:00.110
and continue to let them see us live happily.

32:00.110 --> 32:01.440
That's all we need to do.

32:08.480 --> 32:10.660
I didn't expect you

32:10.680 --> 32:14.890
to say such sensible things sometimes.

32:15.820 --> 32:17.510
Don't really treat me like a dog.

32:17.510 --> 32:19.040
Call me Quzhuo.

32:19.400 --> 32:21.160
You are just Puppy Li.

32:21.240 --> 32:22.510
No, call me Quzhuo.

32:22.510 --> 32:23.400
What Puppy Li?

32:24.070 --> 32:24.720
Hurry up.

32:33.830 --> 32:36.370
Go on, Puppy Li.

32:38.110 --> 32:40.170
Still refusing to admit you're a dog.

32:55.620 --> 32:57.440
Dongfang Huaizhu.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.680
You think you can escape?

33:04.060 --> 33:06.800
I've already become one with you.

33:07.200 --> 33:11.320
I'm just temporarily suppressed for now.

33:20.830 --> 33:21.760
You fell asleep?

33:25.440 --> 33:26.400
Lotus seed soup.

33:29.920 --> 33:31.720
Go get ready after you finish it.

33:32.750 --> 33:35.150
Today is the annual Wulan Festival in the Beast Kingdom.

33:35.150 --> 33:36.420
I want to take you out

33:36.720 --> 33:37.780
and give you a gift.

33:48.160 --> 33:49.960
Rabbit. Rabbit.

33:53.880 --> 33:54.880
Rabbit. Rabbit.

33:55.030 --> 33:55.810
I want this one.

33:55.810 --> 33:56.350
Okay.

33:56.350 --> 33:56.810
Rabbit.

33:58.000 --> 33:59.060
No need for change.

33:59.070 --> 33:59.830
Thank you.

34:01.790 --> 34:03.160
Is this for Qinlan?

34:03.400 --> 34:04.570
It's for you.

34:04.750 --> 34:06.110
It's very sweet. Try it.

34:07.550 --> 34:10.320
Miss, I want that rabbit too.

34:15.190 --> 34:16.110
You can have it.

34:16.670 --> 34:17.800
Thank you, Miss.

34:18.440 --> 34:19.280
Let's go.

34:20.750 --> 34:22.110
We have a rabbit now.

34:28.190 --> 34:29.250
What are you doing?

34:29.280 --> 34:30.550
Huaizhu is out with Hongye.

34:30.550 --> 34:31.760
Why should you be worried?

34:31.760 --> 34:35.159
It's exactly because it's Hongye that
I'm even more worried.

34:38.320 --> 34:41.590
What's going on in that
little head of yours?

34:42.330 --> 34:44.659
I'm worried Huaizhu might be deceived.

34:46.840 --> 34:49.110
Well, since you're so worried about her,

34:50.440 --> 34:52.100
I'll let you see for yourself.

34:52.500 --> 34:53.630
So you'll know

34:53.719 --> 34:54.860
that Hongye

34:55.000 --> 34:57.710
is the best man Huaizhu could
entrust herself to.

34:57.710 --> 34:59.710
Don't be so definitive.

34:59.800 --> 35:01.320
What if after seeing it with my own eyes,

35:01.320 --> 35:02.850
I dislike Hongye even more?

35:03.630 --> 35:04.830
Seeing is believing.

35:05.150 --> 35:05.710
Let's go.

35:23.030 --> 35:24.880
Here's your tea, sir.

35:25.550 --> 35:26.630
That outfit just now

35:26.630 --> 35:28.060
suits her perfectly.

35:28.150 --> 35:30.970
But the price is not cheap.

35:36.880 --> 35:37.760
Thank you, sir.

35:37.800 --> 35:38.920
Thank you, sir.

36:46.710 --> 36:47.900
If I were you,

36:48.400 --> 36:50.040
I would respect her decision

36:50.150 --> 36:51.960
and let her choose who she likes.

37:00.190 --> 37:00.920
Wait for me.

37:21.860 --> 37:23.590
This is the gift I'm giving you.

37:26.000 --> 37:27.400
A bowl of sweet porridge?

37:28.930 --> 37:30.530
The life of ordinary people.

37:30.570 --> 37:31.860
An ordinary day

37:32.010 --> 37:33.340
for an ordinary couple.

37:39.720 --> 37:40.550
Huaizhu.

37:41.570 --> 37:43.730
I know you prefer a quiet and simple life.

37:43.730 --> 37:44.930
What you yearn for

37:45.320 --> 37:47.850
is just an ordinary, carefree life like this.

37:48.320 --> 37:51.590
I believe we will live such a life.

37:52.510 --> 37:54.960
One day, I'm sure we will.

38:09.440 --> 38:11.070
Do you still want to keep following them?

38:11.070 --> 38:11.800
Shut up.

38:23.960 --> 38:25.600
Where are they going?

38:25.900 --> 38:27.300
It's the Wulan Festival.

38:28.030 --> 38:30.710
They're going to make wishes under
the Wulan Tree by Crescent Lake.

38:30.710 --> 38:33.440
Legend has it that if Crescent Lake
becomes Full Moon Lake,

38:33.440 --> 38:35.170
the wishes made will come true.

38:37.320 --> 38:38.250
Do you want to go?

38:41.440 --> 38:42.380
It's late.

38:42.590 --> 38:43.920
Won't you feel cold?

38:44.920 --> 38:45.710
I won't.

38:46.400 --> 38:47.670
I have the Dongfang Spiritual Blood.
